          "Op_code": "2",
          "Name": "ExecuteRecipe",
          "Description": "This instruction will set the device to the specified prefabhash, and then begin manufacturing it. The final element of the payload is the quantity. So you can ask the device to make 200 ItemSteelSheets and it will do that. The quantity is a byte - so the maximum you can request is 255.",
          "Valid Address": "0-53",
          "Bits": "0-7",
